sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Payer as Payer Client
    participant Filter as JwtAuthenticationFilter
    participant TxnCtrl as TransactionController
    participant TxnSvc as TransactionServiceImpl
    participant PinSvc as UpiPinServiceImpl
    participant LockSvc as DistributedLockServiceImpl
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant Outbox as OutboxServiceImpl

    Payer->>Filter: POST /api/transactions/send (Header: Bearer <jwt>)
    Filter-->>TxnCtrl: Authenticated User Principal Set
    TxnCtrl->>TxnSvc: sendMoney(SendMoneyRequest)

    TxnSvc->>DB: findByIdAndUser(senderAccountId, currentUserId)
    TxnSvc->>DB: findByUpiId(receiverUpiId)

    TxnSvc->>LockSvc: acquireLock("LOCK:ACCOUNT:" + senderAccountId)
    LockSvc-->>TxnSvc: Lock Acquired

    TxnSvc->>PinSvc: verifyUpiPin(senderAccount, rawPin)
    PinSvc->>PinSvc: BCrypt.matches(rawPin, account.upiPin)
    PinSvc-->>TxnSvc: PIN Valid (True)

    TxnSvc->>TxnSvc: Validate Balance >= Amount & Generate UTR

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        note over TxnSvc, Outbox: Atomic Spring @Transactional Boundary
        TxnSvc->>DB: UPDATE bank_accounts SET balance = balance - amount (Sender)
        TxnSvc->>DB: UPDATE bank_accounts SET balance = balance + amount (Receiver)
        TxnSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO transactions (UTR, Status: SUCCESS)
        TxnSvc->>Outbox: saveOutboxEvent(TransactionCompletedEvent)
        Outbox->>DB: INSERT INTO outbox_events (Status: PENDING)
    end

    TxnSvc->>LockSvc: releaseLock("LOCK:ACCOUNT:" + senderAccountId)
    TxnSvc-->>TxnCtrl: TransactionResponse DTO
    TxnCtrl-->>Payer: 200 OK (UTR, Amount, Status: SUCCESS)
